    "detailed_description": "Digital Rose is a 2D action-platforming game that focuses on providing a challenging experience within an atmosphere that mixes sci-fi and fantasy elements.<br><br>Set within the Systema Megastructure, you follow the adventures of Jeremy, a cybernetic construction worker armed with a large nail gun, and Alex, a cold vampire with a blade forged from blood. Through two separate campaigns, fight your way through machines and zombies as a mysterious alien race threatens to destroy humanity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story:</h2>In the year 5682, an alien parasite infects the inhabitants of a damaged starship, and causes its security system to go rouge. Once docked, a construction worker named Jeremy boards the ship, where he finds a supernatural vampire leading the infected. There, Jeremy must fight for his life against the vampire and her horde of undead minions.<br><br><br>Over 2,000 years after the starship incident, the Megastructure is filled with a vast number of vampires. One such vampire, Alex, rushes through the Megastructure to rescue her friend from captivity. Unbeknownst to her, a plan to restore all of humanity has been set in motion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10 levels across two campaigns<br></li><li> 5 bosses<br></li><li> 2 playable characters<br></li><li> Various secrets and cheat-codes<br></li><li> Fast and precise movement</li></ul>",
